ype=\"text\" aria-invalid=\"true\" aria-errormessage=\"err-msg-text\"> <span id=\"err-msg-text\">League code is unknown.</span></p>\n  <p><label for=\"err-false\">Squad code</label> <input id=\"err-false\" name=\"squad\" type=\"text\" aria-invalid=\"false\"></p>\n  <p><span id=\"motto-label\">Team motto</span> <span id=\"err-aria\" role=\"textbox\" contenteditable=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-labelledby=\"motto-label\" aria-invalid=\"true\"></span></p>\n\n  <p>How often should we write?</p>\n  <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"freq\" id=\"freq-daily\" value=\"d\"> Daily</label>\n  <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"freq\" id=\"freq-weekly\" value=\"w\"> Weekly</label>\n  <fieldset><legend>Format</legend>\n    <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"fmt\" id=\"fmt-html\" value=\"h\"> HTML</label>\n    <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"fmt\" id=\"fmt-text\" value=\"t\"> Plain text</label>\n  </fieldset>\n  <p>Large print</p>\n  <span role=\"radio\" id=\"aria-radio-loose\" aria-checked=\"false\" tabindex=\"0\">Large print on</span>\n  <div role=\"radiogroup\" aria-label=\"Print size\">\n    <span role=\"radio\" id=\"aria-radio-grouped\" aria-checked=\"false\" tabindex=\"0\">Normal print</span>\n  </div>\n  <p>Topics</p>\n  <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"topic\" id=\"topic-bikes\" value=\"b\"> Bikes</label>\n  <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"topic\" id=\"topic-tours\" value=\"t\"> Tours</label>\n  <p><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"terms\" id=\"terms-single\" value=\"y\"> I accept the newsletter terms</label></p>\n  <fieldset><legend>Channels</legend>\n    <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"channel\" id=\"channel-mail\" value=\"m\"> Letter</label>\n    <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"channel\" id=\"channel-app\" value=\"a\"> App</label>\n  </fieldset>\n\n  <fieldset id=\"fs-unnamed\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"digest\" id=\"digest\" value=\"y\"> Weekly digest</label></fieldset>\n  <div role=\"group\" id=\"grp-unnamed\"><label for=\"grp-in\">Promo code</label> <input id=\"grp-in\" name=\"promo\" type=\"text\"></div>\n  <div role=\"group\" id=\"grp-named\" aria-label=\"Delivery days\"><label for=\"grp-named-in\">Preferred day</label> <input id=\"grp-named-in\" name=\"day\" type=\"text\"></div>\n  <details id=\"det-group\"><summary class=\"solo\">More options</summary><label for=\"det-in\">Referral code</label> <input id=\"det-in\" name=\"referral\" type=\"text\"></details>\n  <p><button type=\"submit\">Save settings</button></p>\n</form>\n</main>\n<footer><p>Example Shop, 2026</p></footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
